From a4fef0ff1e9bda05e1cd195a2fc54c970da601b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:15:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Storefront: consolidated professional menu design, mobile
 product cards, bilingual cart

- Add storefront-final.css as the single source of truth for the menu browser
  (replaces conflicting layered rules): auto-fill grid, 2 vertical cards on mobile,
  full-width add button, no clipped text, consistent tabs/search.
- Stop exposing internal SKUs to customers; remove emoji clutter and duplicate
  search icon; remove stray emoji from CTAs.
- Fix English cart panel (hard-coded direction:rtl), store AR/EN names in cart,
  direction-aware checkout arrow, localized aria-labels, singular/plural.
- Remove render-blocking CSS @import; load Cairo via <link> with preconnect.
- Add OpenGraph/Twitter metadata, viewport + theme-color.
- Remove Vercel wording from customer-facing errors; localize DB offer text.
